{
	"edges":[],
	"nodes":[
		{"color":"4","height":790,"id":"col-backlog","label":"Backlog","type":"group","width":300,"x":0,"y":0},
		{"height":80,"id":"479c83b5bb78b86c","text":"**Publish CapRover one-click app source: add `caprover-one-click.yml` to the Sage-is one-click repo and register it as a custom source in CapRover.**\n`#deployment` `#caprover`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":60},
		{"height":80,"id":"8a505591218c2b62","text":"**Add TodoScope to the `Sage-is/homebrew-apps` tap: write a Formula that pulls the Docker image and wires up a launchd service.**\n`#deployment` `#homebrew`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":150},
		{"height":80,"id":"60af347c61889652","text":"**Introduce user authentication for secure access.**\n`#security` `#auth`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":240},
		{"height":80,"id":"2f5810b68fce2d26","text":"**Implement priority inference from TODO comments.**\n`#core` `#parser`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":330},
		{"height":80,"id":"fd2c513c2f199eeb","text":"**Design a plugin system to extend scanner functionality.**\n`#architecture` `#extensibility`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":420},
		{"height":80,"id":"1cbe6c58baf852e6","text":"**Facilitate integration with task managers (Jira, Asana, Trello).**\n`#integration` `#external`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":510},
		{"height":80,"id":"c9904f4762a88036","text":"**Create a command-line interface (CLI) for versatile use.**\n`#cli` `#accessibility`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":600},
		{"height":80,"id":"00c1ab354a4f2ba7","text":"**Improve visibility of scrollable local repositories list on the main page.**\n`#ux` `#frontend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":10,"y":690},
		{"height":3310,"id":"col-todo","label":"TODO","type":"group","width":300,"x":350,"y":0},
		{"height":80,"id":"f204ba1901df42c5","text":"****Promote login.html into a real landing page**: hero, pitch, features, sign-in**\n  - Add brand hero: headline, subhead (use the one-line pitch verbatim), and a short \"what it is\" paragraph\n  - Add a 3-bullet \"what makes it different\" strip (the inversion, MCP-native, open-source)\n  - Embed the existing `Sage_repo-TODOs.gif` or a fresh screenshot above the fold\n  - Move the sign-in form into a right-hand card or section below the hero — secondary action, not primary\n  - Add \"New to TodoScope?\" copy with a link to the README / GitHub for evaluators who aren't signing in\n  - Add social proof / cross-links to [sage.is](https://sage.is) and [startr.style](https://startr.style)\n  - Add OG meta tags (`og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`) so shared links render properly\n`#brand` `#landing` `#critical`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":60},
		{"height":80,"id":"b10e880ff028a84b","text":"****Surface the MCP / AI agent story on the landing page****\n  - Add a \"Connect your AI agent\" section showing how to point Sage / Claude / any MCP client at the instance\n  - Link directly to `/api/mpco/manifest` and `/api/mpco/openapi.json` from the landing page\n  - Include a one-paragraph framing: \"AI agents are part of your team\"\n`#brand` `#ai` `#mcp`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":150},
		{"height":80,"id":"6c10d18fac8a0268","text":"****Add a dashboard header**: restate the one-line pitch in short form, orient the user**\n`#ux` `#brand`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":240},
		{"height":80,"id":"25207ec22122596d","text":"****Unify repo entry**: one input that accepts a git URL *or* a local path, with smart detection**\n`#ux` `#simplify`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":330},
		{"height":80,"id":"788015369e1cbe90","text":"****Empty state for Repositories**: when no repos are registered, show a friendly onboarding card with 2-3 suggested quick-start actions (scan a demo repo, register a local path, copy MCP endpoint)**\n`#ux` `#onboarding`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":420},
		{"height":80,"id":"8dd0dc1270b62681","text":"****Surface MCP endpoints on the dashboard**: a small \"Connect to an AI agent\" card with copy-to-clipboard buttons for the manifest URL and a sample cURL**\n`#ai` `#mcp` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":510},
		{"height":80,"id":"bb0d8b66e4bad577","text":"****Add search/filter to the Repositories table** (relevant as soon as the list grows past ~10)**\n`#ux` `#search`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":600},
		{"height":80,"id":"b2d4bfdfdd5a23c2","text":"****Add a visible \"last scanned\" timestamp + manual refresh control** per repo row**\n`#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":690},
		{"height":80,"id":"dc041a7d9bd1a938","text":"****Move the GitHub contribute banner to the footer** — it's competing with the primary action**\n`#ux` `#hierarchy`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":780},
		{"height":80,"id":"c0e51db4b3149e80","text":"****Clarify the \"shallow clone\" checkbox**: tooltip or inline help explaining when to use it**\n`#ux` `#copy`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":870},
		{"height":80,"id":"009b77fd62dd8be1","text":"****Create a dedicated `/connect` or `/mcp` page** with step-by-step instructions to wire TodoScope into Sage, Claude Desktop, and generic MCP clients**\n`#mcp` `#docs`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":960},
		{"height":80,"id":"9c75c2bbe97f036d","text":"****Add a \"Copy MCP manifest URL\" button** visible on the logged-in dashboard**\n`#mcp` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1050},
		{"height":80,"id":"ae5fad570207d258","text":"****Write a short guide** — `docs/connect-sage.md` — with screenshots showing an end-to-end Sage → TodoScope query**\n`#docs` `#mcp`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1140},
		{"height":80,"id":"f9ef7750b338de42","text":"****Add an MCP health indicator** to the dashboard: green dot when the manifest endpoint is responding, red when not**\n`#observability` `#mcp`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1230},
		{"height":80,"id":"88852db32b68395c","text":"****Audit all user-facing copy** against the brand interview voice: honest founder tone, clarity-first, never buzzwordy**\n`#copy` `#brand`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1320},
		{"height":80,"id":"1fd2ce1d80e52542","text":"****Error messages**: review for tone — should match the honest founder voice, not generic flask errors**\n`#copy` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1410},
		{"height":80,"id":"d0dc700c6601a810","text":"****First-run wizard**: after setting the first access key, walk the user through registering a repo and connecting an AI agent**\n`#onboarding` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1500},
		{"height":80,"id":"cbd301fe9aa4dff7","text":"****Include a demo/sample repo option** on first visit so the user can see streaming results before registering anything of their own**\n`#onboarding` `#demo`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1590},
		{"height":80,"id":"93eb92f1d2e66ba7","text":"****Add a \"Try it live\" section** to the logged-out landing that runs a preview scan against a public demo repo**\n`#onboarding` `#landing`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1680},
		{"height":80,"id":"8c02d8bed120314f","text":"****Create comprehensive API documentation**: Standalone API reference guide**\n  - Document all endpoints with request/response examples\n  - Add error code reference\n  - Include authentication plans\n  - Test API documentation completeness\n`#documentation` `#api`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1770},
		{"height":80,"id":"0b48bf9a694ede06","text":"****Add architecture documentation**: System design and component overview**\n  - Create component diagram\n  - Document data flow\n  - Document deployment options\n  - Verify architecture docs match current implementation\n`#documentation` `#architecture`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1860},
		{"height":80,"id":"594df020d0234f1e","text":"****Create contributor guide**: Detailed guide for new contributors**\n  - Define code style guide\n  - Document testing requirements\n  - Define pull request process\n  - Test contributor onboarding process\n`#documentation` `#community`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":1950},
		{"height":80,"id":"ba2e03e046a35a5c","text":"****Enhance code documentation**: Add comprehensive docstrings**\n  - Add docstrings to TodoItem class\n  - Document API endpoints with proper docstrings\n  - Add inline comments for complex logic\n  - Verify documentation generation works\n`#documentation` `#code`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2040},
		{"height":80,"id":"e96295b1be28a149","text":"****Create development workflow documentation**: Detailed workflow guide**\n  - Document setup process\n  - Document feature development cycle\n  - Document testing procedures\n  - Test workflow documentation with new developer\n`#documentation` `#development`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2130},
		{"height":80,"id":"81a3505e98fa3876","text":"**Add detection of TODO.md and TODO.txt files. #feature #core (no capitalization needed)**","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2220},
		{"height":80,"id":"af0352ea19f464b4","text":"**Implement a user-friendly web interface for displaying TODO files.**\n`#ux` `#frontend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2310},
		{"height":80,"id":"b9f1b7fd0cfbb6ce","text":"**Include the option to look at the TODO files with our MCPo Api.**\n`#api` `#integration`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2400},
		{"height":80,"id":"0a02ca550329e1f1","text":"**Add summary from repo readme files to the web interface. (optioanlly the top 20lines)**\n`#ux` `#frontend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2490},
		{"height":80,"id":"b235fa9b1d9af8e1","text":"**Implement a search feature for TODO comments.**\n`#search` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2580},
		{"height":80,"id":"cc5e7fe409c641c3","text":"**Develop a dashboard to visualize TODO metrics across projects.**\n`#reporting` `#ux`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2670},
		{"height":80,"id":"8317cbf6c9ac13b5","text":"**Offer report downloads in multiple formats (CSV, JSON, PDF).**\n`#reporting` `#feature`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2760},
		{"height":80,"id":"53dd5c3c45401973","text":"**Integrate with GitHub webhooks for automated repository scanning.**\n`#integration` `#automation`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2850},
		{"height":80,"id":"4bc4eb13c5005ea5","text":"**Enhance TODO file processing:**\n  - Recognize diverse TODO filenames (e.g., TODO.md, todo.txt).\n  - Scan TODO files located in the project root directory.\n  - Extend scanning to TODO files within subdirectories.\n  - Display content from identified TODO files.\n`#feature` `#core`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":2940},
		{"height":80,"id":"6c4237d90243a4d5","text":"****Refactor `stream_results.html` JS**: `createTodoElement()` and `createTodoMarkdownElement()` build DOM by hand with duplicated Startr.style strings. Replace with server-rendered Jinja2 partials + SSE that push HTML fragments, or at minimum extract shared styles into named constants.**\n`#frontend` `#dry`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":3030},
		{"height":80,"id":"fa2c8ee3dc881975","text":"# TODO Scanner v0.0.1\n`README.md:1`","type":"text","width":280,"x":360,"y":3120},
