		{"color":"5","height":200,"id":"col-in_progress","label":"In Progress","type":"group","width":300,"x":700,"y":0},
		{"height":80,"id":"2b5dcca21e5deff8","text":"**Migrate Python files and dependencies to subdirectory structure.**\n  - Create scanner subdirectory.\n  - Implement __init__.py for the subdirectory.\n  - Move error_handling.py to scanner subdirectory.\n  - Update imports in app.py.\n  - Move remaining Python files (test files) to scanner/tests.\n  - Move Pipfile and Pipfile.lock to scanner subdirectory.\n  - Test and update the Makefile accordingly.\n`#development` `#structure`","type":"text","width":280,"x":710,"y":60},
		{"color":"1","height":200,"id":"col-bugs","label":"Bugs","type":"group","width":300,"x":1050,"y":0},
