		{"height":80,"id":"6a95b231865d68fd","text":"****Footer update**: added cross-links to sage.is and startr.style; \"Part of the Startr ecosystem\" framing**\n`#brand` `#footer`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":60},
		{"height":80,"id":"3ac8093ddfb4d80d","text":"****Rename \"Todoscope\" → \"TodoScope\"** consistently across templates, README, caprover manifest, and page titles**\n`#brand` `#consistency`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":150},
		{"height":80,"id":"5c22dd4a736af184","text":"****Favicon**: replaced the clipboard emoji with a telescope (🔭) — consistent with the \"scope\" metaphor in the name**\n`#brand` `#visual`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":240},
		{"height":80,"id":"a7a8d0b933d216d8","text":"****Page titles**: descriptive, brand-consistent `<title>` tags applied to base / index / login**\n`#brand` `#seo`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":330},
		{"height":80,"id":"802e315105c882d9","text":"****Noindex on login page**: added `<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex, nofollow\">` so self-hosted instances don't get indexed**\n`#seo` `#privacy`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":420},
		{"height":80,"id":"3aacb7210671f385","text":"****Meta description**: added the one-line pitch as the default meta description in base.html**\n`#brand` `#seo`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":510},
		{"height":80,"id":"95bf49513a48c702","text":"**Fix the MAJOR issue with existing repositories not working.**\n`#core` `#bug`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":600},
		{"height":80,"id":"665b26b1e9ca1076","text":"**Implement a robust error handling mechanism for the scanner.**\n`#core` `#error-handling`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":690},
		{"height":80,"id":"910d893958555133","text":"**Broaden TODO pattern recognition (e.g., FIXME, BUG, NOTE).**\n`#core` `#parser`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":780},
		{"height":80,"id":"071ecb98db5a67e3","text":"**DRY Makefile targets. (Allow passing args to targets?)**\n`#development` `#testing`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":870},
		{"height":80,"id":"155b4ae89e1c2121","text":"**Enable streaming of API results for improved responsiveness.**\n`#api` `#performance`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":960},
		{"height":80,"id":"395a7411f0635a59","text":"**Implement comprehensive error handling with custom exceptions, retries, and recovery strategies.**\n`#core` `#error-handling`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1050},
		{"height":80,"id":"48da841b93cf383e","text":"**Create testing infrastructure with unit and integration tests.**\n`#core` `#testing`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1140},
		{"height":80,"id":"e9d8ec81cb79d1dc","text":"**Add Makefile targets and test runner for easy test execution.**\n`#development` `#testing`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1230},
		{"height":80,"id":"d882378b0f7672e9","text":"**Honor .gitignore patterns during repository scans.**\n`#core`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1320},
		{"height":80,"id":"dd24a6327de7613d","text":"**Stream scan results efficiently in the web UI.**\n`#ux` `#frontend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1410},
		{"height":80,"id":"dea7e4ee2fcb6053","text":"**Ensure proper HTML escaping for multi-line display.**\n`#security` `#rendering`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1500},
		{"height":80,"id":"46c581e0aeb8c392","text":"**Broaden TODO pattern recognition to include FIXME, BUG, and NOTE in various comment formats.**\n`#core` `#parser`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1590},
		{"height":80,"id":"57bb85cbd74be01e","text":"**Fix server hanging issue: server no longer becomes unresponsive after completing scans.**\n`#critical` `#backend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1680},
		{"height":80,"id":"6b6c471b0e6fca3b","text":"**Skip `scanner/repositories/` when scanning this project as a local repo — prevents recursing into managed cloned repos.**\n`#core` `#backend`","type":"text","width":280,"x":1410,"y":1770}
